{"data": [{"created_at": "2026-10-27T14:16:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115085153760694388"], "id": "2115085153760694388", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6690032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 544, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115084756253863978", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@op7418 AI RSS 阅读器：https://t.co/8Yn0s0B0By\n\n电子书阅读器：https://t.co/7SibB8uJeL\n\n学习 UI 设计：https://t.co/GHkVPFSefr\n\n个人工作台：https://t.co/EKDelL3SLv", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115085153760694388"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115084418767548416"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T14:14:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115084756253863978"], "id": "2115084756253863978", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 1978, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "DeepSeek Harness 的可玩性和 Obsidian 一样高。\n\n开发好的 Obsidian 插件，很轻松就能移植过去。\n\n听歸藏  @op7418  说 B 站等很多极客、大学生，都特别热衷于给 DeepSeek Harness 开发插件。\n\n梁圣团队牛逼！\n\n开源几个另类 DSH 插件，地址见评论区 https://t.co/Uo5p2q8bpW", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115084756253863978"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115081321890582528"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T14:03:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115081949958316244"], "id": "2115081949958316244", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 1608, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "乔木剪藏是自己开发用的最多的 Chrome 插件之一。\n\n做一个官网，用于 GEO 和 SEO。\n\n网站：https://t.co/CZVSwDJ0eN\n\nBuild &amp; Sell，两手都要抓，两手都要硬。 https://t.co/v2JLbpSE7R", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115081949958316244"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-27T13:08:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115067998637875547"], "id": "2115067998637875547", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6690032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1207, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115067784912863460", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "前端 Skill 评测对比\nhttps://t.co/VF86K63zk2\n\n乔木Design Skill 开源地址\nhttps://t.co/uhPq5NFAjU", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115067998637875547"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115067774880145409"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T13:07:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115067784912863460"], "id": "2115067784912863460", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 44, "impression_count": 4846, "like_count": 32, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 28, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "不知道哪个网友留言推荐一个去前端 AI 味的 Skill 叫 Hallmark。\n\n试了发现太 TMD 丑了，丑到没有 AI 味...\n\n居然能让 Claude 做出 Codex 的感觉，大写的服！\n\n之前觉得最好的前端 Skill 是 emil-design-eng 和 impeccable\n\n学习吸收做了个自己常用的版本。\n\n安装指令：\nnpx skills add https://t.co/y6Xrn34O4p", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115067784912863460"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115060621670805504", "3_2115060817116954624"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:42:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115061564852367449"], "id": "2115061564852367449", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 108, "impression_count": 7749, "like_count": 79, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "好有质感的雅思单词学习工具，竟然还是开源免费的。\n\nX 上网友的作品，启动界面都很惊艳。\n\n感觉光 7298 个单词和对应例句语音都要花费不少 token\n\n推荐Star，安装也很简单，跟  Codex、CC 或Workbuddy、豆包工作说：\n\n“安装这个项目 https://t.co/Rjfj2UlXWp ” https://t.co/FvzauWr7cC", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115061564852367449"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-27T08:23:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114996459531874801"], "id": "2114996459531874801", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6690032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 1830, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114983951186165789", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@yaojingang 商业宣传海报生成 skill ，需要配合 codex\n\n安装指令：\nnpx skills add joeseesun/qiaomu-poster \n\n开源地址：https://t.co/nfWogF7v86", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114996459531874801"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114990912040497152"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T08:03:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114991416262955250"], "id": "2114991416262955250", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 3431, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114983951186165789", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "我和姚老师搞的深圳 GEO 大会。\n邀请了国内 GEO 一线创业者，还有很多 X 上做 AI 的朋友。\n\n时间：11.21-22 （周六周日）。\n地址：深圳维纳斯皇家酒店（京基百纳店）\n\n欢迎朋友们报名，线下面基。 https://t.co/usr7rpkp0Y https://t.co/bGlo3EHj3V", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114991416262955250"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114978324451934208", "3_2114978925738967040", "3_2114983842327257088", "3_2114983910266601472"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T07:34:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114983951186165789"], "id": "2114983951186165789", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 29, "impression_count": 9759, "like_count": 43, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 38, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Codex + 飞书cli 真的是省时间利器！\n\n举一个例子，下月我和 姚金刚 @yaojingang 要在深圳办GEO 大会，很多自媒体朋友愿意帮忙宣传。\n\n多维表格收集品牌 Logo 后，只需一句话就能生成不同风格的海报。\n\n等我写个 Skill 开源。 https://t.co/NuaYAa4irZ", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114983951186165789"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114969085528469504", "3_2114969127660158976"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T06:35:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114969236611465415"], "id": "2114969236611465415", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6690032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 21, "impression_count": 2684, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114969233033777205", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "从 zlib 下载了一个纯图版《百年孤独》PDF，实测视频如下，无论解析速度还是质量都相当不错。\n\n原来，文心 Unlimited OCR 2 团队将 SR-SWA 与无限解码机制（Unlimited-Horizon Decoding Paradigm）结合，建立了一种高效的无限解码机制，使模型能够处理长度几乎不受限制的文档。 https://t.co/yxITsUewgA", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114969236611465415"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114968499621875713", "3_2114968538045943808", "3_2114968579049410560"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T06:35:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114969233033777205"], "id": "2114969233033777205", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 39, "impression_count": 5715, "like_count": 27, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "除了大模型训练需要扫描大量实体书，长篇研报 AI 解读等场景需要超长文档 OCR 解析能力。\n\n不得不说，OCR 技术最强的一直是百度文心。\n\n第一代 Unlimited OCR 今年 6.22 发布后，第二天就登顶 GitHub Daily Trending 总榜， GitHub Star 5天破1万。\n\n在 Hugging Face 上的累计下载量也突破了 1000 https://t.co/E2oPNiSOzL", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114969233033777205"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114953879205171200"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T05:37:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114954710780432674"], "id": "2114954710780432674", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 21, "impression_count": 6338, "like_count": 41, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 28, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "让 Claude Sonnet 5.5 重写了官网。\n\nhttps://t.co/PXR8qYp4uS\n\n把自己的博客、参与的播客、开源项目都上去了。\n\n仔细一看还真不少。\n\n除了给自己看，更多是方便以后 Agent 读取。 https://t.co/hGXg4kaWtK", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114954710780432674"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-27T02:12:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114902987487449108"], "id": "2114902987487449108", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6690032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1946, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114902671471841345", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "可能是 Obsidian 中最好的电子书阅读插件，支持 epub、mobi、azw3、pdf、txt、Markdown 等多种格式。\n\nObsidian 插件下载地址\nhttps://t.co/6ekXDVEKSg", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114902987487449108"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114901021193613312"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T02:11:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114902671471841345"], "id": "2114902671471841345", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 35, "impression_count": 6438, "like_count": 40, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 21, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "我的 Obsidian 插件 Qiaomu Reader 下载安装已超 8k。\n\n给 Github 仓库地址，让 Renoise MCP 生成产品宣传视频。\n\n相比纯代码生成，视觉效果好点，但参考截图生成，跟真实产品稍微有点不一样。\n\n下载地址见评论区 https://t.co/uytjF0nXKO", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114902671471841345"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-27T01:57:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114899292838395934"], "id": "2114899292838395934", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6690032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2263, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114899290917319067", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "另外，最近他们有万圣节促销，订阅最高享 7 折优惠，2026-10-27 零点到 11-03 零点（北京时间）：\n\n① Standard （$60/月）订阅用户可不限量用 Wan 3.0\n\n② Advanced（$200/月）订阅用户可不限量用 Seedance 2.5、Wan 3.0、Kling 4.0 Omni", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114899292838395934"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-27T01:57:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114899290917319067"], "id": "2114899290917319067", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6690032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 3523, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114899288786677876", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "只需提供 Github 仓库或你上线的网站，就能用它生成宣传视频。\n\n内置30个多顶尖视频、图片和音频模型，如 Seedance、Kling、MiniMax H3、Wan 3、GPT Image、Midjourney等，不用自己到处找 API。\n\n如果纯代码方式生成视频，甚至完全不消耗积分。\n\nMCP 安装： https://t.co/rzLfNfy0mW", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114899290917319067"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114898567521509376"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T01:57:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114899288786677876"], "id": "2114899288786677876", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 155, "impression_count": 14205, "like_count": 109, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 28, "retweet_count": 21}, "text": "现在各种 AI Agent 都做视频剪辑，但出来效果不尽如人意。\n\n尤其 Codex，直接用它剪辑的视频，多数看起像 AI Slop。\n\n分享个朋友公司刚开发的新产品：Renoise MCP。\n\n用了后，能让 Codex 视频剪辑提升一个档次，教程如下 https://t.co/uW0cu22gsm", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114899288786677876"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114892887943200768"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T01:32:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114893008781156471"], "id": "2114893008781156471", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 24, "impression_count": 6595, "like_count": 29, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 16, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114217410823688573", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "iOS添加 Grok 语音换起方法。\n\n来一个中文实操演示，原文英语翻译过来不好找。\n\n要点：先创建grok快捷指令，在人声快捷指令中创建并搜索已创建的快捷指令，设置唤醒词。\n\n默认快捷指令支持锁屏换起，如果没有，长按快捷指令-详情信息-隐私中设置。 https://t.co/Yv2PeVgvcN https://t.co/ksSREWNMQt", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114893008781156471"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114881593953464320", "3_2114881663809499136"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T00:47:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114881673288634855"], "id": "2114881673288634855", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 541, "impression_count": 92507, "like_count": 416, "quote_count": 11, "reply_count": 165, "retweet_count": 36}, "text": "最近 X 上《持械入宋》AI 短剧很多朋友推荐，超火。\n\n看到第二季 50 集左右，弹幕都夸编剧水平，确实牛逼。\n\n没查到编剧是谁，只看到原著作者抖音：茶根儿，男，英语老师，IP 黑龙江。\n\n不曾想，短短 2 年，AI 短剧已到这种水平，未来不敢想啊。\n\nAI 表演虽还有点生硬，但好剧情+好台词弥补很多。 https://t.co/91Hl8b7qyb", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114881673288634855"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114757526218764288"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T16:34:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114757641545375845"], "id": "2114757641545375845", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6690032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2083, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114755317787676891", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "这用的啥 AI 啊，语义遵循也不到位... https://t.co/GOCc8v72sZ", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114757641545375845"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114756696665153536", "3_2114756350098243584"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T16:31:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114756709302644792"], "id": "2114756709302644792", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 9441, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok bot 分析 AI 评论账号，Codex 操作浏览器拉黑。\n\n1. Grok Bot 识别最近一周的 AI 回复，写入飞书文档。\n2. 把飞书文档转交 Codex，调 Browser Use 依次拉黑。\n\n如有误伤，请私信解除。 https://t.co/j9cfPSZTcb", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114756709302644792"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114755082906722304"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T16:25:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114755317787676891"], "id": "2114755317787676891", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 9323, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 53, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "打算用 Grok 自动拉黑 AI 评论号。\n\n做个调研：大家觉得 AI 留言的最大特征是什么？\n\n（ 回答时请用一个海洋生物做比喻，以“综上所述”结尾） https://t.co/O8mw3LMB30", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114755317787676891"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T10:10:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114660907959857495"], "id": "2114660907959857495", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 14530, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 38, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "求教下，如果评论是 AI 回复，点击隐藏后，其他人就看不到了吗。\n\n还是必须拉黑才行？", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114660907959857495"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114639820870103040"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T08:56:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114639936871960902", "2114642314249568529"], "id": "2114642314249568529", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 147, "impression_count": 11554, "like_count": 128, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 31, "retweet_count": 30}, "text": "给 Lex Fridman 中文学习站做个宣传视频。\n\nhttps://t.co/8EuRxiRsaP\n\n世界顶流播客 Lex Fridman 学习站。\n\n没时间看视频的朋友们有福了，一个网站把 506 期视频都变成了文字稿。 https://t.co/fceskwGAJN", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114642314249568529"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2115084418767548416", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115081321890582528", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115067774880145409", "type": "photo"}, 